<section class="hero wrap">
  <div>
    <div class="eyebrow">A SMALL POND OF THOUGHTS</div>
    <h1>水面不大，<br>也能映照万物。</h1>
    <p class="hero-copy">在这里打捞一点知识、一段日常，偶尔也捧起几行诗。慢慢写，慢慢看。</p>
  </div>
  <div class="pond-graphic" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
</section>
<section class="section wrap">
  <div class="section-head">
    <h2>最近写下</h2><a class="quiet-link" href="<%- url_for('/archive/') %>">查看全部 →</a>
  </div>
  <div class="post-list">
    <% site.posts.sort('date', -1).limit(5).each(function(post) { %>
      <a class="post-card" href="<%- url_for(post.path) %>">
        <time class="post-date" datetime="<%= date_xml(post.date) %>"><%= date(post.date, 'YYYY · MM · DD') %></time>
        <div>
          <h3><%= post.title %></h3>
          <p><%= strip_html(post.description || truncate(strip_html(post.content), { length: 92 })) %></p>
        </div>
        <% if (post.categories && post.categories.length) { %><span class="tag"><%= post.categories.first().name %></span><% } %>
      </a>
    <% }) %>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section wrap">
  <div class="section-head"><h2>沿着不同的水线</h2></div>
  <div class="category-grid">
    <a class="category-card" href="<%- url_for('/categories/science/') %>"><b>科普文章</b><span>把复杂的事，说得清楚一点。<br>从自然现象到生活里的科学。</span></a>
    <a class="category-card" href="<%- url_for('/categories/daily/') %>"><b>日常记录</b><span>留下一些普通日子的纹理。<br>散步、阅读与偶然所得。</span></a>
    <a class="category-card" href="<%- url_for('/categories/literature/') %>"><b>散文诗歌</b><span>让语言在实用之外，<br>也保留一点自由的呼吸。</span></a>
  </div>
</section>
